		<DataType>
			<Name GUID="{52DE4A9D-2E48-60BC-5D45-5024561077B2}" AutoDeleteType="true">FB_SwitchRouter</Name>
			<Comment><![CDATA[ L4b — Switch routing (výhybkový automat).
 Aligns left (C) and right (D) double-track switches based on drive direction.
 State machine: IDLE → IMPULSE_C → CHECK_C → [IMPULSE_D → CHECK_D →] IDLE
 Impulse runs up to 1 s; stops early if position sensor confirms switch moved.
 Runs only when inEnable = TRUE (set by FB_MachineControl).]]></Comment>
			<BitSize>2560</BitSize>
			<SubItem>
