		<DataType>
			<Name GUID="{247C37FB-C25B-FA34-1A56-F075ACB22EC3}" AutoDeleteType="true">FB_MachineControl</Name>
			<Comment><![CDATA[ Machine controller — PackML state router.
 Responsibilities:
   - Combine HW + SCADA inputs and detect edges.
   - Handle E-STOP and child FB faults (highest priority, interrupt any state).
   - Call the active state FB each cycle (bExecute := TRUE).
   - Read outCmd from the active state FB and perform the transition.
   - Forward outputs (enables, init signals) from the active state FB.

 Each state FB owns:
   - Its own logic, timers, sub-machines.
   - Resetting its internals when bExecute goes FALSE.
   - Deciding WHEN to transition (via outCmd).
 MachineControl decides IF the transition is allowed and updates eState.]]></Comment>
			<BitSize>4864</BitSize>
			<SubItem>
				<Name>inBTN_Start</Name>
				<Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000030}">BOOL</Type>
				<Comment><![CDATA[ --- HW buttons (TRUE = pressed) ---]]></Comment>
